# Go build artifacts (native .o from CGo) - ours are checked in via bpf2go
# We do not exclude *.o wholesale because internal/collector/*_bpfel.o and
# *_bpfeb.o are generated eBPF objects that consumers of this repo need
# for `go build` to work without clang installed.
